{"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A wallet holding real credentials is only as trustworthy as the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"platform it runs on. The package enforces some of this itself: without","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/development","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", receiving credentials needs a key","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"store and a credential store that both say they’re durable","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore\/isDurable","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore\/isDurable","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"), and services on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"loopback addresses are refused. The rest is the app’s.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Keys-and-storage","level":3,"text":"Keys and storage","type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Keep ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"’s defaults: keys in the Secure Enclave,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"persistent, and holder keys asking for Face ID, Touch ID or the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"passcode before each presentation. Add ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSFaceIDUsageDescription"},{"text":" to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the Info.plist.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":": complete data protection, out of backups.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/InMemoryCredentialStore","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" is for tests.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Call ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/sweepOrphanedKeys(in:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" at launch, before any issuance,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so keys an interrupted issuance left don’t accumulate.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A device restored from a backup has no holder keys: its credentials","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"show ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/holderKeyPresent","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" as false and can’t be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"presented. Delete them, and receive them again.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"The-Wallet-Provider","level":3,"text":"The Wallet Provider","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Issuers trust the wallet because its Wallet Provider attests it. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"production Wallet Provider should attest a wallet and its keys only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"after checking App Attest evidence that it’s talking to your genuine","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"app on a genuine device, and should keep its own signing key in an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"HSM. The demo wallet’s provider 